<title>POLAND: BETON STAL PAYS PLN 14.1 MLN FOR STAKES.</title>
<headline>BETON STAL PAYS PLN 14.1 MLN FOR STAKES.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction firm Beton Stal SA paid 14.1 million zlotys for the minority stakes it bought this week in two firms formed from state-owned tourist agency Orbis SA, Beton Stal said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>On Thursday Beton Stal said it had bought 26.6 percent of Orbis Transport Sp z o.o. and 25.1 percent of PBP Orbis on December 31 from International Business Management Sp.z.o.o.  -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
